     A                                      DSPATR(HI)
     A                                  6 21'LAST DAILY BATCH PROCEDURE WAS ABN-
     A                                      ORMAL'
     A                                      DSPATR(HI)
     A                                      DSPATR(BL)
     A N90                                  DSPATR(ND)
     A                                  8  6'Date:'
